# NOTE: Render static sites do NOT read this _headers file (Netlify/Cloudflare Pages
# format only). Retained as documentation of the intended cache policy. Live config:
# render.yaml, render.staging.yaml (headers block), and Cloudflare dashboard rules.
#
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
